---
// The home page's feature overview: the features on one side, a window on the other that shows the selected one — a
// screen recording, a screenshot or a terminal session — played one after another by <rc-demo> (see
// demo-player.ts). The terminal sessions come from real runs of a small example project, abridged; the screen
// recordings and the editor screenshots show that example project too.
